{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"maximal ideal maximal ideal","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md","fileName":"Maximal Ideal.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Maximal Ideal","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-13 19:40\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Prime Ideals and Noetherian Algebra]] · [[Quotient Rings and Ideals]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Prime Ideals and Noetherian Algebra","Quotient Rings and Ideals","Ideal","Quotient Ring","Field","Local Ring","Residue Field","Prime Ideal","commutativealgebra.pdf","essentialsofmodernalgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"maximal ideal maximal ideal","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md","fileName":"Maximal Ideal.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Maximal Ideal","heading":"Maximal Ideal","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A maximal ideal is a proper [[Ideal]] that is contained in no other proper ideal. Equivalently, its [[Quotient Ring]] is a [[Field]].\n\nEvery proper ideal is contained in at least one maximal ideal. A [[Local Ring]] has exactly one maximal ideal, and its quotient by that ideal is the [[Residue Field]]. Since fields are integral domains, every maximal ideal is a [[Prime Ideal]].\n\nThe source relates maximality to field quotients and uses maximal principal ideals in polynomial rings to construct extension fields. Thus maximal ideals become a mechanism for adjoining roots as well as an order-theoretic property.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Prime Ideals and Noetherian Algebra","Quotient Rings and Ideals","Ideal","Quotient Ring","Field","Local Ring","Residue Field","Prime Ideal","commutativealgebra.pdf","essentialsofmodernalgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"maximal ideal maximal ideal","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Maximal Ideal.md","fileName":"Maximal Ideal.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Maximal Ideal","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[commutativealgebra.pdf]]\n\n[[essentialsofmodernalgebra.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Prime Ideals and Noetherian Algebra","Quotient Rings and Ideals","Ideal","Quotient Ring","Field","Local Ring","Residue Field","Prime Ideal","commutativealgebra.pdf","essentialsofmodernalgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}